---
title: "Doobey"
artist: "Kausar Munir"
key: "F"
tags: ["hindi"]
---

Doobey Guitar Chords with strumming pattern easy lesson from Bollywood Hindi movie Gehraiyaan sung by Kausar Munir, OAFF, Lothika and Savera.

Strumming Pattern:

[F] [Dm] [Am] [C]

[F]Tera mera [Dm]dono ka dil besabar [Am],        [C]Basabar besabar
[F]Shaam o seher dono [Dm]ka dil bekhabar [Am],        [C]Bekhabar bekhabar

[F]Lo kashtiyaan humari [Dm],        [Am]yun takraa gayin [C]
[F]Leher leher [Dm]dono ka dil besafar [Am],        [C]Besafar besafar

[Am]Haan doobey Haan [C]doobey,        [F]Haan Doobey Ek doojey mein yahan [Am]
[Am]Haan doobey haan [C]doobey,        [F]Haan Doobey Uff ye gehrai [Am]yaan

[Am]Haan doobey [C]haan Doobe,        [F]Haan Doobey Ek doojey mein yahan
Hai [Am]saanson mein saman [C]dar,        [F]Hai dil mein dhuaan

[Am]Dheere dheere aisey girey [C]bijliyaan [F],        [C]Tu bhi main bhi beasar
[F]Bheege bheege dekho [Dm]roohein,        iss [Am]kadar
[C]Beasar beasar

<!-- Post Middle -->

[F]Lo apne [Dm]kinaarey,        Yun [Am]takraa gaye [C]
[F]Lehar lehar dono [Dm]ka dil besa [Am]far,        Uff [C]ye gehraaiyaan

[Am]Haan doobey Haan [C]doobey,        [F]Haan Doobey Ek doojey mein yahan [Am]
[Am]Haan doobey haan [C]doobey,        [F]Haan Doobey Uff ye gehrai [Am]yaan

[Am]Haan doobey [C]haan Doobe,        [F]Haan Doobey Ek doojey mein yahan
Hai [Am]saanson mein saman [C]dar,        [F]Hai dil mein dhuaan

Reh Jaega Kya,        Jo beh gya yaha
Chal Beh jae yaha,        ho jaega kya
jo khogye yaha,        chl koi jae yaha

